The web apps in panel/, memory/ and room/ were started from an app template. Before this release the template's
install-page and web-app-manifest scripts, its bundled install-page assets, its environment-flag wrapper, its
sign-in and connector code, and the tests that only exercised those files were removed. Sign-in was replaced by
a small single-owner module written for this project (src/lib/auth in memory/ and room/).

Some supporting files may still originate from the same template, and their original licence terms were not
available when this repository was prepared: the embedded-database bootstrap and migration scripts
(src/lib/db.ts, scripts/migrate.mjs, scripts/migration-plan.mjs, scripts/copy-pglite-*.mjs, scripts/*pglite*.mjs),
src/lib/error-component.tsx, src/lib/utils.ts, and the UI primitives in src/components/ui. If you rely on them,
check with the template's publisher. Open an issue if you can identify the source and we will correct this notice.

This notice is an inventory, not legal advice.
